# Do NOT ignore these, despite what some upstream templates say:
#   fp-lib-table, sym-lib-table  - needed to open the project elsewhere
#   *.kicad_dru                  - design rules; KiCad docs say to commit it
#   *.kicad_jobset               - the CI output configuration itself
#   *.csv, *.xml, *.net          - BOM, pick-and-place, netlists
#   *-cache*                     - needed to load legacy .sch files

